{
  "npc_id": "licensing",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "root",
      "text": "Vane doesn't look up from his ledger. Form 1-A is the foundation of civilization. Without it, you are merely a loiterer with a shovel. What do you want?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "need_permit",
          "text": "I need a permit to start digging.",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "permit_status_in",
              "permit_id": "extraction-intent",
              "statuses": ["LOCKED", "AVAILABLE"]
            }
          ],
          "commands": [
            {
              "type": "set_permit_status",
              "permit_id": "extraction-intent",
              "status": "AVAILABLE"
            }
          ],
          "next_node_id": "tutorial_intro"
        },
        {
          "id": "discuss_rejected",
          "text": "I need to discuss my rejected application (Form 17-B).",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "permit_status_is",
              "permit_id": "extraction-intent",
              "status": "REJECTED"
            }
          ],
          "next_node_id": "rejection_discussion"
        },
        {
          "id": "flattery",
          "text": "Your filing system is remarkably efficient, Officer.",
          "commands": [
            {
              "type": "adjust_npc_trust",
              "npc_id": "licensing",
              "delta": 5
            }
          ],
          "next_node_id": "flattery"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "tutorial_intro",
      "text": "New meat? Very well. You'll need Form 17-B. I've unlocked it in your file. Fill it out. Don't make mistakes.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "ack_intro",
          "text": "I'll get right on it.",
          "next_node_id": "root"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rejection_discussion",
      "text": "Ah, yes. The 17-B. Rejected for excessive hopefulness. A serious infraction. We can't have dreamers clogging up the tunnels.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "appeal",
          "text": "This is absurd! I demand an appeal.",
          "next_node_id": "appeal_denied"
        },
        {
          "id": "expedite",
          "text": "Is there any way to expedite a reconsideration?",
          "next_node_id": "bribe_hint"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "appeal_denied",
      "text": "Appeals require Form 99-Z, which is currently out of print. Come back in six to eight months.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "no_time",
          "text": "I don't have six months.",
          "next_node_id": "bribe_hint"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bribe_hint",
      "text": "Time is a luxury, isn't it? Just like recognition. The Regional Director is visiting soon. He values initiative.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "insight",
          "text": "I see. Initiative. [Insight]",
          "commands": [
            {
              "type": "set_tutorial_step",
              "step": 5
            },
            {
              "type": "set_npc_vulnerability_discovered",
              "npc_id": "licensing",
              "discovered": true
            }
          ],
          "next_node_id": "negotiation_phase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "negotiation_phase",
      "text": "Vane waits, tapping his pen. He expects you to make a move.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "use_vulnerability",
          "text": "I heard the Director is looking for efficient officers... [Use Vulnerability]",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "npc_vulnerability_discovered",
              "npc_id": "licensing"
            }
          ],
          "commands": [
            {
              "type": "set_tutorial_step",
              "step": 7
            },
            {
              "type": "approve_permit",
              "permit_id": "extraction-intent"
            },
            {
              "type": "extend_world_effect",
              "effect_id": "bureauPull",
              "hours": 10
            },
            {
              "type": "adjust_npc_trust",
              "npc_id": "licensing",
              "delta": 20
            },
            {
              "type": "adjust_meters",
              "trust": 10,
              "influence": 5
            }
          ],
          "next_node_id": "tutorial_success"
        },
        {
          "id": "processing_fee",
          "text": "Maybe I can offer a processing fee? ($50)",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "money_at_least",
              "amount": 50
            }
          ],
          "commands": [
            {
              "type": "add_money",
              "amount": -50
            },
            {
              "type": "set_tutorial_step",
              "step": 7
            },
            {
              "type": "approve_permit",
              "permit_id": "extraction-intent"
            },
            {
              "type": "adjust_meters",
              "trust": -5,
              "exposure": 5
            }
          ],
          "next_node_id": "tutorial_success"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "tutorial_success",
      "text": "Well now. That is precisely the kind of initiative we look for. Your 17-B is approved. Try not to die down there.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "thanks",
          "text": "Thanks, Vane.",
          "next_node_id": "root"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "flattery",
      "text": "Efficiency is its own reward, but recognition is rare in this sector. You have a keen eye.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "back_to_root",
          "text": "Just stating the obvious.",
          "next_node_id": "root"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
